{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/3b7f0dda5a0cbd087ba167580fedf236.avif?t=1769134739\" width=1000 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EMITIME is a rhythm-based deck-building game - where music is your strategy!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME combines rhythm, deck builder, and grid-based strategy to create something unique, and enjoyable! Perform attacks and move around the grid to the rhythm and activate your skill cards to defeat enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your cards by attacking and moving on the beat, then activate them to deal great damage to the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.poster.avif?t=1769134739\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.webm?t=1769134739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.mp4?t=1769134739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different cards have different ability and attack patterns... use them to your advanatge to defeat different enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.poster.avif?t=1769134739\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.webm?t=1769134739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.mp4?t=1769134739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick new cards as you encounter enemies during the battles, and equip yourself with powerful skills to defeat them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.poster.avif?t=1769134739\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.webm?t=1769134739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.mp4?t=1769134739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME features a Roguelike Mode which allows you to replay the game more than one... if not many times! Expand your deck as you meet new enemies on the procedurally generated map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/28c116d3f294842030110443f1bd5aa1.avif?t=1769134739\" width=1560 height=884 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Future Plans</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will feature two different characters (and more to come...), each with different movesets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a story mode where you follow the background story of the characters which are from the past and future ... including the duo protagonists - Aldrich, a royal engineer from the past, and Albert a farmer / combatant from the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/fd53f214c540a0108fc2265b022dc558.avif?t=1769134739\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921640?t=1769134739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/57282dc148159abfc8faa27e61e0fa5e02458a04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769134739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/cad5bd6e82bce4246060061063b012ea3c04a982/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769134739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/cad5bd6e82bce4246060061063b012ea3c04a982/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769134739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/3b7f0dda5a0cbd087ba167580fedf236.avif?t=1769134739\" width=1000 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EMITIME is a rhythm-based deck-building game - where music is your strategy!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><